{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A\u00a0Shattered Heart, A\u00a0Supernatural Guide:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Rise From Betrayal to Become the Alpha\u00a0You Were Meant to Be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/192a91bde94cd9d24ad8dd1f2fede783.avif?t=1757042525\" data-has-big width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0story follows a heartbroken\u00a0college student whose world crumbles when his girlfriend Jane cheats on him with the campus\u00a0quarterback. Dylan, once confident and ambitious, finds himself isolated and humiliated as malicious rumors destroy\u00a0his reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/6a459576b5be6a41b2cfab876533e633.poster.avif?t=1757042525\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/6a459576b5be6a41b2cfab876533e633.webm?t=1757042525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when despair threatens to consume him completely, a mysterious voice from his\u00a0damaged phone offers an unlikely alliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bull Phone, a supernatural entity with its own\u00a0agenda, promises to transform our\u00a0protagonist from victim to victor. But this power comes with a\u00a0price - he must prove himself\u00a0worthy through a series of increasingly\u00a0bold encounters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605 Branching\u00a0Consequences \u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every\u00a0choice shapes your transformation across\u00a06 compelling episodes. Build genuine connections or pursue pure conquest\u00a0- your decisions determine which of\u00a0multiple endings you'll achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/7457ba2986cc5335f9258b9b49efdb46.poster.avif?t=1757042525\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/7457ba2986cc5335f9258b9b49efdb46.webm?t=1757042525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/7457ba2986cc5335f9258b9b49efdb46.mp4?t=1757042525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605 Complex Characters\u00a0\u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with\u00a0a diverse cast of women, each with their own motivations, desires, and backstories. From college students to professional\u00a0women, each relationship offers unique\u00a0challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/782a65a705cdf47f62b1e7f2a3a549d4.avif?t=1757042525\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605 Stunning Visuals\u00a0\u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over 24 meticulously crafted intimate scenes with fluid frame-by-frame animation. Each\u00a0encounter is brought to life through\u00a0detailed artwork that captures both passion\u00a0and emotion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585000?t=1757042525","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585000?t=1757042525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/ba0f39f03f6fd3ba585369a7d30bfa8fcded147c/cap